<%--
Undefined_Component_Tag_Override_Main - test harness for an UNREGISTERED
component's tag resolution and default CSS classes.

Never_Defined_Component has no register_component()/register_template() call
anywhere in this test directory - it is deliberately left unknown to the
registry so DEFAULT_TEMPLATE (component-registry.ts) and the tag precedence
logic in instruction-processor.ts (~line 294) are exercised.
--%>
<Define:Undefined_Component_Tag_Override_Main>
  <div>
    <h1>Undefined Component Tag Override Test</h1>
    <Never_Defined_Component tag="nav" $sid="with_tag" />
    <Never_Defined_Component $sid="without_tag" />
    <p id="results"></p>
  </div>
</Define:Undefined_Component_Tag_Override_Main>
